## Interface: 11601
## Title: Squawk Spy
## Notes: Detects and alerts you to the presence of nearby enemy players. A re-work of the Spy addon by Immolation and Slipjack, rebuilt for WoW: Forever. Artwork and sounds are theirs, read from your installed copy of Spy.
## Version: 2.0.0
## Author: Avoid Me <Squawk>
## X-Credits: A re-work of Spy, created by Immolation and updated by Slipjack. Spy's artwork and sounds remain their work and are not redistributed here.
## SavedVariables: SquawkSpyDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Creature_Cursed_02

# --- SavedVariables restore shim -------------------------------------------
# The Forever beta writes SavedVariables correctly but never restores them,
# so every addon starts each session with an empty database.  SV1..SV3 are
# directory junctions to the WTF SavedVariables folders; loading our own file
# as a normal addon file puts last session's data back.  Each Restore file
# parks the snapshot so the next one does not overwrite it.
SV1\SquawkSpy.lua
Restore1.lua
SV2\SquawkSpy.lua
Restore2.lua
SV3\SquawkSpy.lua
Restore3.lua

# Lists saved while the addon was still called SpyF, read once and carried
# over by Core.lua.
SV1\SpyF.lua
Legacy1.lua
SV2\SpyF.lua
Legacy2.lua
SV3\SpyF.lua
Legacy3.lua

Core.lua
Detect.lua
Guild.lua
UI.lua
Menu.lua
Stats.lua
Options.lua
